      "texts": {
        "caption": "National Hazing Prevention Week is almost here!\n\nJoin us September 21–25 for a week of education, awareness, and action as we come together to build a safer Highlander community. From educational webinars to Purple with a Purpose and our Pledge to Lead event, there are plenty of ways to get involved and take a stand against hazing.\n\n📲 Check out the schedule and join us next week!\n\n#NHPW2026 #LeadTheChangeUCR",
        "slide_1_ocr": "NATIONAL HAZING\nPREVENTION WEEK\n21\nMON\nWEBINAR: Building an Effective Hazing\nPrevention System: The Four-Domain\nFramework in Action\n→ 9 AM\nWEBINAR: The Charge for Change:\nAuthors and Contributor's Vision for\nPolicy and Practice Reform at the Top\n→ 9 AM\n23\nWED\n22\nTUE\nWear purple to show\nawareness to the issue of\nhazing!\nPledge to Lead: Take the anti-hazing\npledge and grab a free popsicle!\n(Outside the FSIC, HUB 2 101A)\n11 AM - 3 PM\nUC RIVERSIDE Student Life\n24\nTHUR"
      }
    },
